  "id": "collative-properties",
  "term": "collative properties",
  "definition": "Collative properties are features of a stimulus—such as novelty, uncertainty, and complexity—that combine to create its arousal potential. In this context, they are the qualities that help shape emotional responses by influencing how much information or surprise a stimulus carries.",
